It is Saturday morning.
It is winter in Denmark.
The weather is very cold today.
I am standing in a large square in the city.
There is an outdoor market here.
I look at the many stalls.
They all look inviting.
There are many people in the square.
People are wearing warm winter clothes.
I only have a thin jacket on.
I have a large bag with me.
The bag is completely empty right now.
I am looking for fresh food for the weekend.
The market has many fresh goods.
I see vegetables, fruit, and bread.
I think about the prices.
How much do things cost here?
I walk over to the first stall.
